namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamEventSystem {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem
    src   "A player's input, as a level places it and a Blueprint reaches it.\n\nThe input itself -- the pointers, what they hover and press, the device, the cursor, the dispatch -- belongs\nto the player (UDreamUIInputUser), which the world's input subsystem owns and runs. This component speaks\nfor one player, UserIndex: its details panel is that player's settings, written into the player when it\nbegins play; its functions read and change the player's input; its events relay the player's. It no longer\nticks -- the input subsystem's tick function runs every player's frame -- and it keeps nothing a player could\nlose with it: an event system destroyed with a sub-level lets its player's hovers and presses go, properly.\n\nAbout event bubble: if all interface of target component return true, then event will bubble up. if no\ninterface found on target, then event will bubble up"
    text  "玩家的输入，由关卡放置、由蓝图访问。\n\n输入本身——指针、指针悬停和按下的对象、设备、光标、事件分发——属于\n玩家（UDreamUIInputUser），由世界的输入子系统拥有并运行。此组件代表\n一个玩家，即 UserIndex：它的细节面板就是该玩家的设置，在玩家开始游戏时\n写入；它的函数读取和修改该玩家的输入；它的事件转发该玩家的事件。它不再\nTick——输入子系统的Tick函数驱动每个玩家的帧——它也不保存任何玩家可能随它一起\n丢失的东西：随子关卡一起销毁的事件系统会妥善释放其玩家的悬停和按下。\n\n关于事件冒泡：如果目标组件的所有接口都返回 true，则事件会向上冒泡。如果未\n在目标上找到接口，则事件会向上冒泡"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:ActivateNavigationInput {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:ActivateNavigationInput
    src   "Set the pointer's inputType as navigation.\n@param InPointerID target pointer's ID.\n@param InDefaultHighlightedComponent default highlighted component for navigation input."
    text  "将指针的 inputType 设为导航。\n@param InPointerID 目标指针的 ID。\n@param InDefaultHighlightedComponent 导航输入的默认高亮组件。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:bAnimateNavigationScroll {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:bAnimateNavigationScroll
    src   "Ease that reveal scroll instead of jumping to it."
    text  "让该显示过程使用缓动滚动，而不是直接跳转过去。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:bApplyHoverCursor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:bApplyHoverCursor
    src   "Let hovered widgets drive the hardware cursor (UDreamWidget::Cursor).\n\nOn by default, because a cursor that changes over a button is how a player learns what is clickable. Off\nfor a project that owns the cursor itself -- an RTS with a build cursor, a game with a custom software\ncursor -- so the two do not write the same field on alternate frames."
    text  "让悬停的控件驱动硬件光标（UDreamWidget::Cursor）。\n\n默认开启，因为光标在按钮上发生变化正是玩家了解什么可点击的方式。对于\n自行管理光标的项目——带有建造光标的 RTS、使用自定义软件\n光标的游戏——请关闭，以免两者在不同帧写入同一字段。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:bScrollNavigationTargetIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:bScrollNavigationTargetIntoView
    src   "Scroll the containers around a navigated-to widget until it is on screen. Off, navigation can only reach\nwhat is already visible."
    text  "滚动导航目标控件周围的容器，直到它出现在屏幕上。关闭时，导航只能到达\n已可见的内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:ClearEvent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:ClearEvent
    src   "Let go of every pointer: each hovered widget gets its Exit, each pressed one its Up, each drag its end.\nAfter the event being dispatched, when called from a handler."
    text  "松开所有指针：每个被悬停的控件收到 Exit，每个被按下的控件收到 Up，每个拖拽收到结束。\n当从处理程序中调用时，在正在分发的事件之后执行。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:CurrentInputModule {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:CurrentInputModule
    src   "The input module registered through this event system; its player's, once it has one."
    text  "通过此事件系统注册的输入模块；一旦该事件系统有了所属玩家，则为该玩家的输入模块。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:DoubleClickTime {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:DoubleClickTime
    src   "How long after a click a second press on the same widget still counts as a double click -- and a double\nclick is delivered at that press, in place of its down, as Slate delivers one. The press also has to land\nwithin the pointer's drag threshold of the first (see UDreamBaseRaycaster::IsWithinDoubleClickDistance).\nZero disables double clicks entirely, and makes every press a down."
    text  "在点击之后多长时间内，对同一控件的第二次按下仍算作双击——双击\n在该次按下时投递，替代其 down，与 Slate 的投递方式一致。该次按下还必须落在\n第一次按下的指针拖拽阈值之内（参见 UDreamBaseRaycaster::IsWithinDoubleClickDistance）。\n为零则完全禁用双击，每次按下都作为 down 处理。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:ExecuteEvent_OnPointerEnter {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:ExecuteEvent_OnPointerEnter
    src   "The handlers on a widget, with nothing else: no player, no broadcast. Blueprint tools for dispatching an event\nby hand; a player's own events go through its UDreamUIInputUser, which dispatches with these and broadcasts."
    text  "控件上的处理程序，仅此而已：不涉及玩家，不进行广播。用于手动分发事件的\n蓝图工具；玩家自身的事件通过其 UDreamUIInputUser 处理，后者用这些处理程序分发并广播。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:GetCurrentGamepadModel {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:GetCurrentGamepadModel
    src   "Which pad the player is holding. Generic until one is used and named by the platform. Read from the pad that sent\nthe player's latest pad input, again whenever that is another pad, rather than polled."
    text  "玩家当前握持的手柄。在某个手柄被使用并由平台命名之前为通用值。从发送\n玩家最近一次手柄输入的那个手柄读取，当换成另一个手柄时再次读取，而不是轮询。"
    state machine
}

