DreamEventSystem:GetDreamEventSystemInstance {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:GetDreamEventSystemInstance
    src   "The event system for player UserIndex: the one placed for that player, or -- when none is -- one no actor\ncarries that speaks for the player all the same.\n        // static-checks: allow(ufunction-param) the Blueprint pin has always been UserIndex; renaming it would unhook every node"
    text  "玩家 UserIndex 的事件系统：即为该玩家放置的那个；若没有，则为\n一个没有 Actor 承载、却同样代表该玩家的事件系统。\n        // static-checks: allow(ufunction-param) 蓝图引脚一直是 UserIndex；重命名会断开每个节点"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:GetGamepadModelForDeviceName {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:GetGamepadModelForDeviceName
    src   "The model a platform device name implies, as a pure function so it can be tested without hardware. Both\nhalves of the descriptor are consulted because platforms disagree about which one carries the brand."
    text  "平台设备名称所隐含的型号，以纯函数形式提供，因此无需硬件即可测试。会同时\n查看描述符的两部分，因为各平台对品牌信息位于哪一部分存在分歧。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:GetInputDeviceForKey {
