    src   "Classify a key. Gamepad and touch keys announce themselves; everything else is a keyboard."
    text  "对按键进行分类。手柄按键和触摸按键会自行标识；其余按键都视为键盘。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:GetPlayerController {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:GetPlayerController
    src   "The player controller this event system speaks for -- the local player at UserIndex, not \"whoever is\nfirst\". Null when that local player does not exist, except for index 0, which falls back to the first\ncontroller so a single-player game keeps working before any local player is registered."
    text  "此事件系统所代表的玩家控制器——即 UserIndex 处的本地玩家，而不是“谁排在\n第一位”。当该本地玩家不存在时为空，但索引 0 例外：它会回退到第一个\n控制器，让单人游戏在任何本地玩家注册之前仍能正常工作。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:GetPlayerControllerForUser {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:GetPlayerControllerForUser
    src   "The player controller for a user index, without needing an event system in hand.\n\nThis is the one place the \"which player is this?\" question is answered, so that a raycaster source, a\ntooltip or a rumble call cannot quietly disagree with the pointer they were handed. Every\nUDreamPointerEventData carries the index of the player that made it."
    text  "按用户索引获取玩家控制器，无需持有事件系统。\n\n这里是回答“这是哪个玩家？”这一问题的唯一位置，从而让射线投射源、工具\n提示或震动调用不会悄悄与其收到的指针产生分歧。每个\nUDreamPointerEventData 都携带产生它的玩家的索引。"
    state machine
}

DreamEventSystem:GetPointerClockSeconds {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamEventSystem.h#DreamEventSystem:GetPointerClockSeconds
    src   "The clock every timed pointer gesture is measured on: the PressTime, ReleaseTime and ClickTime stamps on\nUDreamPointerEventData, and everything measured against them -- long press, the double-click window, swipe\nduration, hold-to-drag -- plus navigation repeat.\n\nThe world's REAL time: not stopped by a pause, not stretched by time dilation. The UI keeps working while\nthe game is paused, so a pause menu is exactly where a held press still has to become a long press and two\nclicks a second apart still have to be two clicks. Slate times its own double clicks and key repeat in real\ntime for the same reason.\n\nOne function so that the code writing a stamp and the code measuring it cannot disagree about which clock\nit is: compare a stamp on the event data against this, never against the game clock.\n@return      Seconds on that clock, or 0 when the object is in no world."
    text  "所有计时指针手势所依据的时钟：UDreamPointerEventData 上的\nPressTime、ReleaseTime 和 ClickTime 时间戳，以及一切以它们为基准的度量——长按、双击窗口、滑动\n时长、按住拖动——再加上导航重复。\n\n世界的真实时间：不会因暂停而停止，也不会因时间膨胀而拉伸。游戏暂停时 UI 仍在\n工作，因此暂停菜单正是这样一处地方：按住的按压仍须变成一次长按，相隔一秒的\n两次点击仍须算作两次点击。出于同样的原因，Slate 也以真实时间计算自己的双击和按键\n重复。\n\n只有一个函数，使写入时间戳的代码与度量它的代码不会对究竟是哪个时钟\n产生分歧：将事件数据上的时间戳与它比较，永远不要与游戏时钟比较。\n@return      该时钟上的秒数；对象不在任何世界中时为 0。"
    state machine
}

